{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Remembered</b> — He said: זכר corresponding to זכרו. And this is the covenant of the pieces." "And the meaning of זכר — that it not be forgotten." "<b>He commanded</b> — like גזר, as in: 'YHWH did not command.'" "And the meaning of 'for a thousand generations' — for the name of Israel shall not be cut off, and furthermore he shall yet inherit the land of Canaan forever."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 105, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:24.145872465Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}